  "remarks": "Vladimir Bobrov is the former Director of MG-Flot LLC (previously known as TransMorFlot LLC). MG-Flot LLC is a Russian shipping company providing logistical support to the Ministry of Defence of the Russian Federation. In particular, MG-Flot LLC is involved in a military transportation network of Russian cargo vessels shipping North Korean armaments from Pyongyang to military facilities in the Russian port of Dunai. Subsequently, North Korean munitions transported by MG-Flot LLC are transferred to depots on Russia’s western border to be deployed in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. Additionally, vessels owned by MG-Flot LLC have been involved in weapons shipments from Iran to aid Russia’s full-scale invasion of Ukraine.",
